00:01:49.430 --> 00:01:53.100
Modern machine intelligence,
a branch of computer science

00:01:53.100 --> 00:01:55.880
to build systems to
perform similar functions

00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:59.710
to human intelligence, such
as learning, reasoning,

00:01:59.710 --> 00:02:02.040
self-correcting, and adapting.

00:02:02.040 --> 00:02:05.730
And it allows us to do
some astonishing things.

00:02:05.730 --> 00:02:09.810
Just within financial services,
which is my specialization,

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:13.740
it allows us to manage
risk much more effectively.

00:02:13.740 --> 00:02:19.310
It allows us to survey
activity much more effectively.

00:02:19.310 --> 00:02:22.690
In essence, it promises
