high dimensionality data.

00:02:47.070 --> 00:02:51.900
And of course the caveat is
that there's more and more data.

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:55.130
The amount of data is
increasing exponentially.

00:02:55.130 --> 00:02:58.360
The need to make
use of that data

00:02:58.360 --> 00:03:00.760
