00:03:09.650 --> 00:03:12.110
And that's where Google
Cloud Platform comes in,

00:03:12.110 --> 00:03:16.290
to give you scale and
the ability to interact.

00:03:16.290 --> 00:03:20.130
Which leads us to a premised
architecture for analysis

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:22.750
and machine learning.

